// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO8-11 (radio SPI bus), GPIO14 (radio
// DIO0), GPIO17/18/21 (OLED I2C), GPIO36 (Vext power-gate) - see
// vendor pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard PRG/BOOT
// switch (Heltec HTIT-WB32_V3 schematic doc, pin table: "GPIO0,
// connect to PRG switch").
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO35 (pins_arduino.h LED_BUILTIN/LED) is
// vendor-confirmed as the onboard LED write-control line (Heltec
// HTIT-WB32_V3 schematic doc pin table: "GPIO35 ... LED Write
// Ctrl") but is deliberately left untagged/unexcluded here - it
// already has no chipGpios entry (excluded via the chip-level
// GPIO33-37 octal-flash/PSRAM policy inherited from
// variants/esp32/esp32s3/board.json). Re-adding it would mean
// touching a pre-existing pin exclusion, which is outside this
// task's scope.
